        "kind": "pull_request",
        "title": "fix(elevenlabs): validate baseUrl with descriptive errors for malformed endpoints (fixes #106943)",
        "body": "## What Problem This Solves\n\nA malformed ElevenLabs `baseUrl` produces a raw `TypeError` from `new URL()` deep in the call chain. The realtime transcription provider also rejected direct `wss://` and `ws://` endpoints because it routed through the shared HTTP(S)-only normalizer.\n\nFixes #106943.\n\n## Fix\n\nTwo independent normalizers with scoped scheme validation, following the Deepgram pattern from #105334:\n\n- `normalizeElevenLabsBaseUrl` (shared REST/TTS/speech): validates `http`/`https`. Rejects query strings and fragments with descriptive errors. Preserves URL userinfo for proxy credentials.\n- `normalizeElevenLabsRealtimeBaseUrl` (realtime): validates `http`/`https`/`ws`/`wss`. Same query/fragment rejection and userinfo preservation.\n\nThe realtime URL builder maps `http→ws` and `https→wss` while preserving direct `ws`/`wss` endpoints.\n\n## Evidence\n\n### Function probe (real production normalizers)\n\n```\n$ node --import tsx -e \"import { normalizeElevenLabsBaseUrl } from ./extensions/elevenlabs/shared.js\"\n\ndefault:     https://api.elevenlabs.io\nvalid https: https://api.elevenlabs.io\nuser:pass@host: https://user:pass@proxy.example.com/v1   (preserved)\n\nquery rejected:\n  Error: Invalid ElevenLabs baseUrl: query string is not supported\nfragment rejected:\n  Error: Invalid ElevenLabs baseUrl: fragment is not supported\n```\n\n### Vitest output (65/65 tests pass, 6 files)\n\n```\n$ npx vitest run extensions/elevenlabs/ --reporter=verbose\n\n Test Files  6 passed (6)\n      Tests  65 passed (65)\n```\n\n### Key behaviors verified\n\n- [x] Malformed URL → descriptive error (not raw TypeError)\n- [x] Unsupported scheme → descriptive error\n- [x] Query string → rejected (not silently stripped)\n- [x] Fragment → rejected (not silently stripped)\n- [x] Userinfo preserved for proxy credentials\n- [x] Direct `ws://`/`wss://` endpoints accepted for realtime\n- [x] HTTP→WS, HTTPS→WSS protocol mapping preserved",
        "branch": "fix/issue-106943-elevenlabs-baseurl-validate",
        "head_sha": "0350ba38639b622c231dacff0c775a169f9c313e",
